  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 10200,
    "z0": 10200,
    "x1": 12920,
    "z1": 12920
   },
   "text": "The fire finder. Its sights are still set on a bearing: 047.\nNorth-east, down in the valley. Where the smoke is."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 10540,
    "z0": 6290,
    "x1": 12240,
    "z1": 7820
   },
   "text": "The log. 01.20, SMOKE SIGHTED, NE, BRG 047. AIRCRAFT? RADIOED, NO ANSWER.\n03.00, DOGS AT THE FOOT OF THE TOWER. 04.40, BURNING UP. CANT STOP SCRATCHING.\nThe last line just says: THEY'RE ON THE STAIRS."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12240,
    "z0": 6290,
    "x1": 14110,
    "z1": 7820
   },
   "text": "The radio set's dead. The handset hangs on its cord."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 11900,
    "z0": 12920,
    "x1": 13260,
    "z1": 14110
   },
   "text": "A board of keys by the door. One tag says SWITCH HOUSE."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 12410,
    "z0": 7480,
    "x1": 12920,
    "z1": 10710
   },
   "text": "His cot. Blood on the canvas, and scratch marks in the wall.\nHe tore at himself."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 14620,
    "z0": 11560,
    "x1": 15810,
    "z1": 13940
   },
   "text": "The top rail's broken. Blood on the post.\nThis is where he went over."
  },
  {
   "zone": {
    "x0": 14450,
    "z0": 4590,
    "x1": 15810,
    "z1": 8500
   },
   "text": "Smoke, rising out of the trees in the valley. Something came down there.\nBravo's helicopter. And far off, a big house among the trees."
  }
 ],
